From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakob Linke <jgruber@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:19:16 +0200
Subject: [regexp] Propagate Trace::Flush errors

ActionNode::Emit and Node::LimitVersions ignored errors from
Trace::Flush, so compilation continued until the final size check.
Propagate these errors, mark EmitResult V8_NODISCARD, and CHECK in
Compiler::Assemble that Emit reported every code generation error.

Fixed: 573263262
Change-Id: I8c90ca5191f2f39fd5ae11a615e6bd493b6882d8
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8576040
Reviewed-by: Patrick Thier <pthier@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Jakob Linke <jgruber@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Jakob Linke <jgruber@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#110775}

